tool.folder.description=Operate on session folders for this runtime. Operations: getCurrent, listFolders, listThreads, listProjectThreads, createAndAssign, assignCurrentThread, unassignCurrentThread, moveThreadToFolder, removeThreadFromFolder, rename, setMetadata, deleteMetadata, markDone, delete. The markDone and delete operations require interactive confirmation.
tool.list.agents.description=List the Air agents that can take a task in a new session. Use the returned launchTargetId and interactionSurfaceId with air_start_session. Each agent lists its models and reasoning efforts. An empty models list means the harness selects its default.
tool.start.session.description=Delegate a complete task to another agent in a new session of this project. The new session uses its own harness defaults. The result confirms the launch, not task completion. Pass modelId when the task names a model. On MODEL_UNAVAILABLE, call air_list_agents again.
tool.await.sessions.description=Wait for current turns of child sessions that this automation started. Return bounded transcripts, changed files, and requested artifacts. A timeout returns ready results and reports timed_out for the rest.
tool.await.sessions.description.without.changed.files=Wait for current turns of child sessions that this automation started. Return bounded transcripts and requested artifacts. A timeout returns ready results and reports timed_out for the rest.
tool.follow.up.description=Queue a prompt for the source session that triggered this automation. Use a stable requestId when retrying a call.
argument.operation=One supported operation name.
