argument.interactionSurfaceId=The interactionSurfaceId from air_list_agents.
argument.prompt=The complete task and context for the agent.
argument.modelId=A model id or name from air_list_agents. Omit it for the harness default.
argument.reasoningEffort=A reasoning effort supported by the selected model. Omit it for the harness default.
argument.threadId=The child session thread id.
argument.timeoutSeconds=The common timeout in seconds, from 1 through 1800.
argument.targetThreadId=The source session thread id.
argument.requestId=A stable id for an idempotent request.
